=== QS001 profile: styleq | an underscore in a name, which is also the drop operator
some_name:1

=== clean profile: style | the same name says nothing outside the styleq profile
some_name:1

=== QS002 profile: styleq | a dot that is not a namespace
myspace.myvar:1

=== clean profile: styleq | a leading dot is a namespace, which is the spelling the guidance asks for
.myspace.myvar:1

=== QS003 profile: styleq | `l` reads as `1`
l:1

=== clean profile: styleq | a name long enough to read
len:1

=== clean profile: styleq | a name being read rather than assigned is not this file's choice
r:some_other_lib_call[1]

=== QS004 profile: styleq | a single token wrapped in parentheses
r:(1)+2

=== QS004 profile: styleq | a name likewise
r:(t)

=== clean profile: styleq | parentheses that group more than one token
r:(a+b)*c

=== clean profile: styleq | a call is not a parenthesised operand
r:g(1;2)

=== clean profile: styleq | drop reads as a token once its string is masked, and is not one
r:count (1_"abc")
